OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDrying up,
OL,6,Fthough rain may linger for a time in
OL,7,Fthe far north. A calm and cold night,
OL,8,Fespecially under increasing amounts of
OL,9,Fclear spells where frost or fog
OL,10,Fpatches may develop before dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cold morning, maybe
OL,13,Ffrosty. Then, a chilly day with lots
OL,14,Fof cloud, and some isolated showers
OL,15,Ffocused in the north. Spells of
OL,16,Fautumnal sunshine in the south and
OL,17,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
