OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFoggy
OL,6,Fand frosty mornings for Sunday then
OL,7,Fbecoming crisp and sunny. Becoming
OL,8,Fcloudy with light rain on Monday ahead
OL,9,Fof overnight rain. Milder, wetter and
OL,10,Fwindier on Tuesday.
